# Optional. Raises the Google Books quota. Never commit a real key.
# The source reads it as `process.env.VITE_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY`; `define` in vite.config.ts feeds
# it (replaced in the bundle by `vite build`, set as a global at runtime by the dev server). In CodeSandbox's browser sandbox, put the same line
# in a `.env` file at the root of your fork.
VITE_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=
